          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can Billings businesses recover value from retired IT equipment?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Some Billings businesses may have eligible technology that can be evaluated for reuse or asset remarketing before final recycling. STS can assess retired computers, laptops, servers, and related equipment as part of a broader IT asset disposition project. Equipment without reuse value can be routed for responsible processing. Billings organizations should provide device types, quantities, age, condition, and available asset information when requesting a project review or electronics recycling quote."
